+### 4.2a Semantic calibration S0 (before any band)
+
+- **Anchor:** the single item X returned by the T_start call. Record k = its stars and d = its creation day (UTC).
+- **Required counts:**
+
+  | Query | Expected count |
+  |---|---|
+  | `repo:X stars:k..k+10` | 1 |
+  | `repo:X stars:k-10..k` | 1 |
+  | `repo:X stars:k..k` | 1 |
+  | `repo:X stars:k+11..k+20` | 0 |
+  | `repo:X created:d..d+1` | 1 |
+  | `repo:X created:d-1..d` | 1 |
+  | `repo:X created:d..d` | 1 |
+  | `repo:X created:d+1..d+2` | 0 |
+
+  Together these verify inclusive endpoints, single-value ranges and sanity, for both partition dimensions.
